  "body": "Vendor said present all offers! \r\n\r\nPotential this is the one you've been waiting for: a beautiful family home on an extraordinary 1,282m2 (more or less)  FREEHOLD section in one of Torbay's most loved, quiet streets. Our vendor is highly motivated and fully committed to selling - all offers are warmly welcomed!\r\n\r\nTHE HOME- LOVELY, LIGHT & READY FOR YOU. Step inside and feel the warmth immediately: two beautifully spacious double bedrooms, and a single room also a space for an office.  \r\n\r\nAbsolutely enormous separate living area, truly grand in size, offering plenty of room for relaxing, entertaining, or creating distinct zones for family and friends to enjoy,\r\n\r\nCombined kitchen and dining space: bright, welcoming, and perfectly for daily meals and gathering together.\r\n\r\nSun-drenched, spacious deck- your outdoor living dream: perfect for morning coffee, family dinners, summer entertaining, or simply relaxing in the sun.\r\n\r\nWALKING DISTANCE TO EVERYTHING: Beach, local shops, and bus stations are all just minutes away.\r\n\r\nCOME AND SEE IT - YOUR CHOICE: Call for a private viewing one-on-one viewing at a time that suits you? Just message or call me directly - I'm flexible and happy to meet you there.\r\n\r\nOpen Homes- You're also warmly welcome to join our public open homes.\r\n\r\nGet in touch today- don't miss your chance to see this beautiful home before it's gone!\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
